{"duration_api_ms":136175,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a7564aa7-164f-43c3-b809-a1b1ddb32554","total_cost_usd":0.201274,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16015,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":13721,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8967},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13721,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16015},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13721,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16015,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.201274,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":8967,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is a one-parameter curve in flight_path_angle_deg. Every front point has D≈3.385, bluntness 1.2 and cone 70, and only gamma varies. It runs from (227k W/m2, 417.9 K) at gamma -1.5 to (274.6k, 391.1 K) at the max_g limit near gamma -3.570. HV has stalled at about 0.3555 for the last three rounds. The other limits are also hit. Mass fraction caps D at about 3.3852, since the margin is about 1.4e-4 at D=3.385. Bluntness above 1.2 and cone below 70 return extrapolation failures. Lower bluntness gives negative mass margin.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-948029610632 to C-bdc4c0de77cb: the front runs from gamma -1.5 to -3.5702 at fixed D, bluntness and cone, with flux rising about 47k and temperature falling about 27 K.\",\"C-bdc4c0de77cb and C-4440e1af7d55: D=3.3852 sits at both the max_g and mass_fraction limits, so there is no room left in D or gamma.\",\"C-363a563b3536 (D=3.3) and C-2a109f1c4205 (D=3.36): smaller D raises flux and does not help temperature. g rises about 0.4 g/m with D and about 1.65 g/deg with gamma.\",\"C-7112b6b29bcf, C-14444dd6b10a, C-9961e7e6987c: lowering bluntness raises flux and makes the mass margin negative.\",\"C-de59f8abeee6, C-ae614eb129f2, C-98457c6f78bd, C-ea0e387c4c00: bluntness above 1.2 or cone below 70 at bl 1.2 are outside the cd_fore hull, so the corner (bl 1.2, cone 70) is the buildable optimum.\",\"C-960c10206981 and C-3edf701da501: smaller D with steeper gamma gives 356-372k flux with about 399-402 K, dominated by the front.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak flux falls with nose radius and with ballistic coefficient, which is why D, bluntness and cone are pushed to their limits. Mass fraction caps D. Bondline temperature falls with steeper gamma through a shorter soak, and max_g caps how steep gamma can go. The trade-off is therefore set by gamma alone. The flux exponent in D of about -1.5 is fitted from C-363a563b3536 against the D=3.385 rows. The remaining HV gain is small, from filling gaps on the curve and from pushing D from 3.385 to 3.3852. The interpolated outcomes below are between neighbouring front rows; the exploratory D=3.2 row is an extrapolation, and that flux rests on my fitted exponent.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The gains are tiny because the front is saturated. The D=3.3852 rows sit about 1e-5 from the mass-fraction limit, and the tiny margin differences between C-4440e1af7d55 and C-bdc4c0de77cb suggest a slight gamma dependence, so some of them could turn out infeasible. The interpolated values are accurate to about 0.5 K and about 500 W/m2. The D=3.2 point is a probe and I expect it to be dominated.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the shallow-gamma gap between -1.62 and -1.8 by interpolation.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front where the gamma spacing is largest.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.85 and -1.95.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.05 and -2.15.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":408.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.15 and -2.33.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.24},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":243000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.38 and -2.57.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.47},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":248300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.45,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.57 and -2.82.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":253700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.82 and -3.09.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front where the spacing is widest.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.82 and -3.09, close to -3.09.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.02},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.13 and -3.24.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.17},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":265000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.15,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.24 and -3.42.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.33},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.47 and -3.525.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.53 and -3.55.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.545},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.33,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.55 and -3.562, close to the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.558},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front near the g limit; max_g is expected to stay under 12.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"Use D=3.3852, the largest D that meets the mass limit, at the shallow-gamma end. This should trim flux by a few tens of W/m2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.87,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Test whether D=3.3852 still passes the mass limit at shallow gamma and slightly dominates C-948029610632.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -2.05, to slightly dominate C-5b7da58ad0af.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238690,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.25,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Check whether the mass margin depends on gamma at this D, since it is only about 1e-5.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -3.0, in the middle of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":260900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.05,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front and check mass-fraction feasibility at mid gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -2.6, filling the gap between -2.57 and -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251350,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -1.75, filling the shallow-gamma gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.75},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":232200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -2.0, filling the gap between -1.95 and -2.05.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -3.2, filling the gap between -3.13 and -3.24.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":265700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.85,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densify the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-363a563b3536\",\"rationale\":\"Exploratory probe at smaller D=3.2, where max_g allows a slightly steeper gamma. It tests whether steeper gamma can offset the higher flux; I expect it to be dominated.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.2,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.61},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":298600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Confirm that the D-flux exponent (about -1.5) and the D-g trade-off make smaller D dominated, using one data point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":101129,"type":"result","duration_ms":136212,"uuid":"4b1cb1e8-1aa5-4b27-87d8-4e95a901bd96","ttft_stream_ms":1015,"time_to_request_ms":35,"first_content_frame_ms":1015,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
